numbers -- output numbers and their parameters
==============================================

numbers is a C program that outputs numbers and their parameters.
Options limit the output to prime, triangular, odd, even, square or
perfect numbers.

Building and installing
-----------------------

    autoreconf -i     # only when building from the repository
    ./configure
    make

See INSTALL for generic instructions.

Reporting bugs
--------------

Report bugs to <mdddmmmm@yandex.ru>.

